{"unit_id":"elviszhang007__dsh-moyan#card-zh","repo":"elviszhang007/dsh-moyan","commit":"58e4abc1622a3c572b47602ab2ee3fc8b035f3a5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"墨言是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的侧边栏语录插件，会在侧边栏设置项上方显示一条名言、诗词或游戏台词，并附出处。它通过 sidebar.footer.action 插槽挂载界面，由宿主端提供可编辑语料文件，浏览器端支持每日或每次打开换句、手动刷新和回退最近显示内容。语料可直接编辑 corpus.txt，刷新页面后加载；语料不可用时使用内置列表。适合希望在编程会话中浏览短句并自行维护语料的用户；无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:657-666","lib/index.js:13-40"]}
{"unit_id":"elviszhang007__dsh-moyan#card-en","repo":"elviszhang007/dsh-moyan","commit":"58e4abc1622a3c572b47602ab2ee3fc8b035f3a5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"MoYan adds a sourced quote above the settings row in the DSH web sidebar. It mounts through a sidebar slot and loads editable corpus.txt, with a built-in fallback. Users can choose daily or per-open refresh, request another quote, or return to recent quotes. No API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:657-666","lib/index.js:13-40"]}
